	(text "BenchPod v4 pogo fixture, rev 3. Passive: a controller BenchPod drives J1.\nP1-P8: SMD pogo pins (BWCD-L6.5W2.0H2.0, LCSC C2826552) reflowed by JLC, under the pod's\nJ10 (P1-P6: SWD, NRST, console) and J12 (P7-P8: 5 V before the input eFuse, GND).\nThe board lies flat in the printed stand: its posts come up through H1/H2 to the pod's\nH11/H14, H3/H4 screw it to the stand."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 91.44 66.04 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c24443e9-c7c4-4d32-a366-a9451ffbeb92")
	)
